    "debrief.title": "Correlating outbound traffic versus proving exfiltration",
    "debrief.summary": "Related destinations appear in DNS, HTTP, and SMTP records for 192.0.2.34. Outbound transmission is observable, but its content and business legitimacy are unknown; confirming data loss requires more investigation.",
    "debrief.stages.0.title": "Start with name resolution",
    "debrief.stages.0.detail": "The first related record is a DNS query at 11:15:02 UTC. Treat archive-sync.example’s answer 198.51.100.202 and mail-relay mx.archive-sync.example’s 198.51.100.203 as different destinations.",
